=== filename-completion-desired-for-words
# matches from a custom generator are treated as filenames when the
# application sets rl_filename_completion_desired
--- dir somedir
--- script
def fn
set rl_filename_completion_desired 1
set rl_attempted_completion_function NULL
end
complete_words somedir
set rl_completion_entry_function words
set rl_attempted_completion_function script:fn
readline "> "
--- keys
som\t<dump>\r

